OL,3,GNEWSANo extra cash for Town Hall
OL,4,Arevamp, leader says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe leader of Manchester City Council
OL,7,Fhas said there will be no extra cash
OL,8,Ffor restoring the city's historic Town
OL,9,FHall.
OL,11,FThe project's original budget was #330m
OL,12,Fbut has since risen to almost #525m,
OL,13,Ffollowing delays and unexpected
OL,14,Fproblems during the restoration.
OL,16,FGarry Bridges said the project was now
OL,17,Fcoming in on its revised budget and
OL,18,Fthere would be "no more increases".
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
